OL,3,CBoy's heart restarted after crash
OL,5,FA boy's heart was restarted by
OL,6,Fparamedics after a serious crash in
OL,7,FBirmingham.
OL,9,FAn off-duty nurse and police performed
OL,10,FCPR on the schoolboy, who was a
OL,11,Fpassenger in one of the cars, before
OL,12,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service
OL,13,Farrived.
OL,15,FThe crash was at the junction of
OL,16,FSisefield Road and Primrose Hill in
OL,17,FKings Norton at around 6pm on 28 July.
OL,19,FParamedics gave advanced life support
OL,20,Fwhich restarted his heart.
