OL,3,CBoy's heart restarted after crash
OL,5,FHe was rushed to hospital in a
OL,6,Fcritical condition.
OL,8,FThe ambulance service said: "A two-car
OL,9,Fcollision in Birmingham last night has
OL,10,Fleft a boy in a critical condition.
OL,12,F"West Midlands Ambulance Service
OL,13,Freceived multiple 999 calls reporting
OL,14,Fa two-car collision at the junction of
OL,15,FSisefield Road and Primrose Hill,
OL,16,FKings Norton, Birmingham shortly
OL,17,Fbefore 6pm yesterday.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785415712
OL,3,CBoy's heart restarted after crash
OL,5,F"Two ambulances, two paramedic
OL,6,Fofficers, a trauma team, a critical
OL,7,Fcare paramedic and a Midlands Air
OL,8,FAmbulance responded to the scene."
OL,10,FAn ambulance service spokeswoman
OL,11,Fadded: "When ambulance staff arrived,
OL,12,Fthey found an off-duty nurse and
OL,13,Fpolice colleagues performing CPR on a
OL,14,Fboy, a passenger from one of the
OL,15,Fvehicles involved.
OL,17,F"The team of ambulance staff quickly
OL,18,Ftook over resuscitation efforts to
OL,19,Fadminister advanced life support which
OL,20,Fsuccessfully restarted his heart.
OL,26,@sD@HOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
