PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785415712
OL,3,CBoy's heart restarted after crash
OL,5,F"The boy was rapidly conveyed by land
OL,6,Fambulance on blue lights and sirens to
OL,7,FBirmingham Children's Hospital for
OL,8,Ffurther emergency care.
OL,10,F"The driver of the same car, a woman,
OL,11,Fwas assessed and found with injuries
OL,12,Fnot believed to be serious. She was
OL,13,Ftreated on scene before being taken to
OL,14,FQueen Elizabeth Hospital Birmingham.
OL,16,F"Two occupants of the second car, a
OL,17,Fman and woman, were assessed and found
OL,18,Fto have sustained minor injuries. Both
OL,19,Fwere left in the care of police
OL,20,Fcolleagues."
